<title>USA: Mobil hires Shell finance official.</title>
<headline>Mobil hires Shell finance official.</headline>
<dateline>FAIRFAX, Va. 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mobil Corp said Monday Martha Frances (Fran) Keeth will join the company September 1 and be proposed for election as controller of Mobil Corp and Mobil Oil Corp.</p>
<p>Keeth was formerly head of finance for the worldwide oil products business of the Royal Dutch/Shell Group.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
